## Third-party dataset attribution

`isl_dataset.csv` is derived in large part (~97% of rows, via
`import_kaggle_dataset.py`) from:

> "Indian Sign Language (ISL)" dataset by prathumarikeri, Kaggle,
> https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/prathumarikeri/indian-sign-language-isl,
> licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0).

The "all rights reserved" statement above applies to this project's own
source code, trained model weights, and documentation. It does NOT
override the CC BY-SA 4.0 terms attached to the portion of
`isl_dataset.csv` derived from the dataset credited above: any
redistribution of that data (or of a derivative dataset/model trained
substantially from it) must itself carry attribution to the original
dataset and be licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 or a compatible share-alike
license, regardless of the license chosen for this repository's own code.
The hand-recorded portion of `isl_dataset.csv` (`session_id` values other
than `kaggle_import` — see `docs/data_collection_protocol.md`) is not
subject to this third-party license.
